{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_09_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_09","title":"篤信者","storyCode":"SV-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f6e70c6b3819830039a65c0227980ab81c11194346d21e76eada6df47a891426","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"主教在狂熱的情緒中變身，獵人們找回了狩獵的感覺。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，動得了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚。克制那種感覺......難。我好難不去想那些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手指沒法動。我一動，我的指甲就好像都會從我手上游走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神經細胞在急速新陳代謝，始終記住，你是個獵人，它們動不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼想有用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想成為海嗣，你就不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......我能拿起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有武器的雜種，重傷的雜種，感染的雜種，你們能做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你那表情是什麼意思？開始覺得自己高貴了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，奇怪......你會錯意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別以為那個海嗣讓我有些難過，你就也配了。砍死你就完事了。 ​"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真以為箱子裡是薩克斯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小美人魚，你還要睡多久？睜眼。過去的事情困不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......她也只是個試驗品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，你早醒了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......這麼高濃度的源石液都......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你的老樣子真不錯，鯊魚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。我都快忘了她是這個性子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，手還是好麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島混了這麼幾年，這點準備我還是做得好的。接著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能讓我再害羞一會嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"做了那麼長時間乖巧的修道女，我都不知道該怎麼面對你們呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來吧。別玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼長時間過去，我也不知道自己是習慣現在的你，還是瘋瘋癲癲又有點自閉的那個了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，好硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，回來！他已經是海嗣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊長，幽靈鯊......先離開這！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......孽種......毀滅——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教的身體極速膨脹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的身體舒展開來，溶洞的岩壁在他長須的揮舞下竟陡然碎裂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們......呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太......高估......自己的命運......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_10"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教的頭顱自他雙眼正中開放。\n眼皮從它巨碩的雙眼上褪下，玻璃體反射出了獵人們倒退的身影。\n而無數觸肢更飛速從它原本瘦削矮小的身體裡奔流而出，甩向這些它原本不屑一顧的蜉蝣。\n海水湧入了溶洞，隨著主教身體的膨大不斷上漲。\n主教扭動著打碎了所有儀器，它的身形幾近海嗣，卻又發洩著人類的狂怒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吵雜而急促的抽動聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會長得這麼大？他是怎麼把那麼多肉塞在這個身體裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你看，他的頭還能分開。記住，右邊的頭給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（神經相互疊合擠壓出的聲響）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們怎麼都這麼心急？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（類似說話的模擬人聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動作慢，獵物就會逃走，或者很快就會死在別的獵人手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急劇晃動骨骼的聲音）......你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（液泡被戳破的聲音）......孽種......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧那人，氣急敗壞，連個成型的句子都吐不出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算人了。這種獵物只在獵人狩獵它的時候才有價值。走！向上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"什......麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"地在晃......海岸旁的山？是不是有東西在掉下來？窗戶這邊可以看見。那是......教堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——屋子也晃個不停，我的盒子，食物......佩特拉奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特拉奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位，現在都請跟我一起到外面去！留在室內會有危險——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我跟你們廢話幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，審判官......一把抱起了佩特拉奶奶？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別愣著了，我知道你能聽懂！這房子有多老了，你心裡沒數嗎？隨便震一震都要塌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不管教堂裡現在怎樣，就那幾位都過去了，搞不好還有......唉！待會會發生什麼我都保證不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"牆灰，磚頭，石柱，壁爐叔！拉住我的手！牆灰你再拉幾個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著審判官......我們先出去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"總算，人應該都在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"山......教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"教士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"倒還惦記著那披著皮的異教分子？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"真是完全不知道誰把你們害成了這樣......呃......唉，算了！你，你不許往前走了！你給我回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特拉奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶......睜開了眼睛？我在這裡，奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"石、石塊！房頂落下來的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，審判官幫我們擋下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶在看著你，審判官，她在感謝你哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就抓著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官，你流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......剛才挨那一下砸，還有點疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你也幫我打過恐魚。就當交換了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，我為什麼要在這裡......你們明明連害怕都不懂。性命受到威脅都不知道逃跑，這還算活著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那個歌......在我腦子裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官，歌手她不在這裡，會不會有問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"有問題......呵，我知道你的有問題不是那種有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果她是那樣的，那她就算有問題，這個問題的答案也不會太爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"要結果的話，就等吧。說不定她真能......給一個好答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要衝進教堂了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"它可沒停下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_11_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"觸鬚向上揚去，將掉落的岩塊一一擊打成粉末，迸射在岩壁上的石子竟然把岩壁打出了裂痕。\n幽靈鯊的圓鋸滋滋作響。觸鬚靠近她的一瞬間，這個“修女”的嘴角微微翹起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"有多久沒對付你這種獵物了？我都有點饞啦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊雙臂一橫，鋸柄撞擊在岩壁上，堅固的花崗岩被撞出一個大坑。\n借助衝力，幽靈鯊輕飄飄地翻身。與此同時，圓鋸卻在她身體下方劃出一道沉重的灰色軌跡，與觸鬚交錯而過。\n刺耳的切割聲響起，觸鬚應聲而斷。\n髮絲上竄的“修女”摸上一塊原本是樓梯的東西，用力一推，繼續向教堂奔去。\n她注視著觸鬚的斷面，幾支細小的幼芽從那接近透明的白色中探出頭來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"聽啊，它體內的細胞在尖叫。很像我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它有感情，它原本是個阿戈爾人......也不。不再是了。以前也算不上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物觸手末端上的苞芽突然綻放，數道尖銳的液體狠狠地刺向了三個獵人。\n斯卡蒂調轉劍柄，大劍被她像盾一樣壓在身下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三道水箭撞在劍身上，斯卡蒂被猛地上推數米，四濺的水花刺進了岩壁，穿射出了細小的孔洞......然後蒸發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它的水流比我工作台上用的水刀流速都快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"它在看我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想想辦法，這東西會這麼無限長下去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_11_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“主教”那巨碩的雙眼忽地放出了異樣的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能量？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在這時，歌蕾蒂婭的長槊飛速地劃過“主教”的視覺器官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一層堅硬的“膜”立刻覆蓋在怪物的雙眼上，長槊的刃尖在腹膜上劃出了一道長痕。\n怪物不滿地嘶嚎，歌蕾蒂婭卻在爆炸般的聲響中向上彈去。\n還差一點，就是建築底部。教堂地面早已被她們的搏鬥震碎，離她們撞上教堂穹頂，也只剩幾秒。\n歌蕾蒂婭卻放緩了速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"劍魚？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了。它的體型和重量，到這裡也就差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_11_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我做的這一切，讓你現在就這麼還了......真是便宜了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別讓它逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......真是夠了。鬧得這麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其他的獵人不算在你頭上，主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這一劍，這劍是為了你們曾經害死的我的家人，我的朋友。海裡的，陸地上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"死吧，混蛋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，死吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_11_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["幽靈鯊"]}]}
